calc(4,r'g\text{ is shown in the qualitative diagram}','(a,b) 양쪽 무한대 극한 (c) 원점 극한 (d,e) 입력 이의 좌우 극한 (f) 점근선을 읽어라.','Read (a,b) limits at infinity, (c) the limit at zero, (d,e) the left and right limits at two, and (f) asymptotes.',[r'x\to\infty:\ g\to2;\quad x\to-\infty:\ g\to-1',r'x\to0:\ g\to-\infty;\quad x\to2^-:\ g\to-\infty;\quad x\to2^+:\ g\to\infty'],r'\text{(a)}\ 2;\quad\text{(b)}\ -1;\quad\text{(c)}\ -\infty;\quad\text{(d)}\ -\infty;\quad\text{(e)}\ \infty;\quad\text{(f)}\ x=0,2,\ y=-1,2',sub='abcdef')
